# MODIFIED-ARROWS-SCREENS: a held arrow, and Ctrl-B and Ctrl-F, at the model's
# question. fx v0.0.16 reads each through its composer move: at a choice the
# choice moves only on visual_up/visual_down extending a selection
# (questionActionFromShortcut, src/ui/input/runtime.zig:178-197@481104fd) --
# Shift-Up and Ctrl-Shift-Up and their Down -- and every other composer move
# reaches the switch's `else` (input_question_runtime.zig:181-200), the bytes
# no question action at a choice (src/ui/input/runtime.zig:135-153). In the
# field a move is the field's when it names one (:155-176): Super-Up and
# -Down the field's edges, Ctrl-F, Shift-Left and Ctrl-B the step, and Ctrl-
# and Shift-Alt-Up and -Down nothing. Each vertical key on a page of its own
# (Tab between), then the horizontal ones on page 7, where going back a page
# would show; then a draft on page 7, a letter typed after each key (each
# vertical key on its own, so a choice move up and one down cannot cancel).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-input-question20-turns.json
wait 4
type ask twenty
key Enter
wait 3
snap p1
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 35 42
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-down
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 41
wait 0.4
snap alt-up
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 41
wait 0.4
snap super-up
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 30 42
wait 0.4
snap shift-super-down
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 34 41
wait 0.4
snap shift-alt-up
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 36 42
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-shift-down
key Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 44
wait 0.4
snap super-left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 32 44
wait 0.4
snap shift-left
key -H 02
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-b
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 32 43
key -H 06
wait 0.4
snap right-keys
type 3
wait 0.4
type ab cd
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 41
wait 0.4
type z
wait 0.4
snap field-super-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 35 41
wait 0.4
type y
wait 0.4
snap field-ctrl-up
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 34 42
wait 0.4
type k
wait 0.4
snap field-shift-alt-down
key -H 06
wait 0.4
type x
wait 0.4
snap field-ctrl-f
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 42
wait 0.4
type w
wait 0.4
snap field-super-down
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 32 44
key -H 02
wait 0.4
type v
wait 0.4
snap field-left
